# Backend-specific ignores. Broad rules (data, results, secrets, __pycache__)
# live in the repo-root .gitignore so they are declared in one place.
#
# NOTE: this file used to contain a blanket `case_files/*`, which also hid the
# UPPAAL models (thermostat-v*.xml, *.q) and the test-suite configs that are
# needed to actually run a case study. Bulk data is now excluded by path in the
# root .gitignore instead.

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

media/
uploads/
results/
db.sqlite3
*.log

.env
